			"notes": "# RENEW SMP MOD\n## Orb of dominance\nNew orb of dominance item inspired by Minecraft Dungeons. Created with nine parts. While having in inventory grants status effects. Each part also gives special effect.\n## Orb of dominance tools\nFrom parts of orb of dominance you can craft new weapons, tools, and armor.\n<details>\n<summary>New boss</summary>\n\n\n## New boss\nNew boss enchanter currently cannot be found in survival. Coming in next update with his own \nstructure.\n\n</details>\n\n## New weapons and tools\n### Cutlasses\nFast sword that deals decent damage\n### Scythes\nTool allowing you to harvest your crops. Compatible with many mods.\n\n## Cosmetics\nAlso there is new way to collect items, which are plushies."
